@ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### 1. Test V1 Products (Legacy format - flat list without category)
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test V1 Product by ID
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Test V2 Products (New format - includes CategoryName & structured response envelope)
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v2/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Test V2 Product by ID
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v2/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Swagger V1 JSON Specification
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Swagger V2 JSON Specification
GET {{ApiVersioningDemo_HostAddress}}/swagger/v2/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
